[en.DECISION_C01_ANGRY_PROD]
Fury-Fueled Production

[en.DECISION_C01_ANGRY_PROD_desc]
Put Cozy Glow's anger to work in an emergency production drive. Factories will run harder and faster, at the cost of greater supply consumption and a further rise in her Anger Value.

[zh.DECISION_C01_ANGRY_PROD]
怒火驱动生产

[zh.DECISION_C01_ANGRY_PROD_desc]
将和煦光流的怒火投入紧急生产运动。工厂将以更高强度加速运转，但补给消耗与她的愤怒值也会随之上升。
